# Nothing is excluded from this repository. The two entries that used to live
# here — stylist/photos.zip and _source/ — kept ~166MB of Canva exports and
# transport archives out of history on the grounds that the live site never
# serves them.
#
# That was the wrong trade for this repo: the source artwork is the thing the
# tracked assets were generated FROM, and split-stylist-cards.py cannot be
# re-run from a clone that doesn't have it. So both are committed now, through
# Git LFS. See the LFS block in .gitattributes for how, and why the 105MB deck
# had no other route onto GitHub.
#
# If you add something genuinely disposable later, it belongs here. Large source
# binaries do not — add them to the LFS patterns in .gitattributes instead.
